menu "HardwareOne standalone STT"
config HW1_STT_MODEL_LOCAL_PREPARE
    bool "Use model-local prepared arguments (experimental)"
    default n
    help
        Prepare each model through its own module objects. Normal execution in
        another model never consults the recognition worker's preparation flag.
        Non-Conv operators do no arithmetic during preparation. Requires the
        isolated and concurrent-model qualification; does not change weights.
        All ESP-DL modules/callers must be rebuilt with the same setting; this
        adds a virtual preparation entry point. A single model still requires
        one execution owner; this does not make that model safe for reentry.
endmenu
